    "sections": {
        "description": "SKT Eye care is clean WordPress theme. It is suitable for vision care and optical care websites. It is perfect for clinics focused on ocular health and eye health. The design suits ophthalmic care and optometry services. You can use it for sites offering vision correction and eyesight care. It also fits businesses in eye treatment and eye wellness. Can be used for pharmacy, medical, wellness, laboratory and other medicine related websites. The theme works with Elementor for easy editing. It is SEO friendly and loads fast. Documentation: https://www.sktthemesdemo.net/documentation/skt-coach-doc/"
